cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gtrack: GPlates-based Tracking of Lithosphere and Kinematics"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for computing lithospheric structure through geological
  time using plate tectonic reconstructions. It uses pygplates to track
  seafloor ages by Lagrangian particle tracking, to advect continental points
  with topological plate models, and to build labelled point clouds of
  lithospheric properties for geodynamic models such as G-ADOPT.
